# Files that run on Linux (in CI, in a container, on the VM) must keep LF line endings whatever the committer's
# platform: a CRLF shebang line fails with "bad interpreter", and a CRLF Caddyfile or Dockerfile misparses.
# backend/tests/test_ci_hygiene.py checks this file and the index.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
Caddyfile   text eol=lf
